      "title": "Claims portfolio description",
      "objective": "Describe the medical claims portfolio for a payer analytics team. Report claim volume and the status mix. Report the denial rate with its numerator and denominator stated explicitly, computed among claims whose adjudication has concluded (claims still pending have not yet been accepted or denied). Report the prevalence of the synthetic fraud label across the whole portfolio, again with numerator and denominator. Summarise billed, allowed and paid amounts with totals, means and distribution quantiles. Show a monthly volume trend keyed to the month in which the service began, and state how many rows had unparseable dates. Every rate in the report must show its denominator. State that the data is synthetic and that the analysis is descriptive.",
